## Why This Is Asked
Tests the ability to design batched updates for a non-trivial dynamic property with practical performance guarantees.

## Key Concepts
- sqrt decomposition; block-level DP profiles; mergeable LIS state; amortized update costs.

## Code Example
```javascript
// sketch: recompute LIS for a block
function recomputeBlock(block) {
  const arr = block.values;
  // standard patience algorithm within block
  let tails = [];
  for (const x of arr) {
    let i = tails.findIndex(t => t >= x);
    if (i === -1) tails.push(x); else tails[i] = x;
  }
  block.lisLen = tails.length;
}
```

